WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,600
You misunderstood, I'm not

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,850
While Huang Xuyang is on a mission, he slowly approaches

3
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:13,030
Qi Xuan will be taken down by me sooner or later. Can I watch it?

4
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:14,930
I also want to learn to fly

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:18,130
When you can release your spiritual power and control it stably, I will teach you.

6
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:22,120
How is this different from being my master?

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,060
I can't always take you away

8
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,660
The road ahead needs to be explored by yourself

9
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,770
Go back to the headquarters directly after class in the afternoon

10
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:31,930
The R&D staff will be here. If you have any questions, you can ask them.

11
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,840
This Qi Xuan is very powerful

12
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,980
It hasn't been long since she joined the job, right?

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,580
There is someone outside

14
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,860
Recruiting new people is a must

15
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,950
So many people have asked for advice

16
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:55,530
Xuecheng finally has a third one
